  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the significance of the phrase 'keep saving the world' in Jiya's message, considering the context of healthcare workers.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the text implicitly advocate for the recognition and appreciation of essential service providers?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('fb4ae789-6d5b-464e-aaa5-4c8374358288', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$As the world outside turned uncertain, Jiya found solace in the virtual realities of online classes and endless video calls. She discovered her inner strength, learnt to adapt to the new normal, attended online classes and connected with her friends through video calls. She also found solace in hobbies like painting and gardening. One day, Jiya’s Grandma fell ill with COVID-19. It was a challenging time for the family, but they supported each other with love and care. Despite the fear and uncertainty, Jiya found courage in her heart. One sombre morning, as Jiya practised her newfound hobby of talking to plants (they're great listeners), her mother delivered the news with a heavy heart, “Grandma has tested positive for COVID-19.” The family’s spirits plummeted, but Jiya wrapped her fear in a blanket of determination. The atmosphere at her Grandma’s bedside was a blend of worry and whispered courage. Jiya squeezed her Grandma’s hand, her voice shaking slightly, “Grandma, how’s the weather up there on your health barometer today?” Her Grandma, always a comedian even in adversity, managed a weak chuckle “Oh, dear Jiya, I'd say it's partly cloudy with a chance of hailstorm. But having you here? That’s my sunshine.” Jiya’s laugh was a mix of relief and concern.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 10, NULL),
  ('37fe81ce-a95a-49b5-9271-2f1fd959bba5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya, a young individual, faced the challenge of juggling school and emotions during a difficult period. Despite her personal struggles and missing cherished moments with her Grandma, she demonstrated remarkable resilience. Following her Grandma's recovery from COVID-19, Jiya was inspired to take action beyond her immediate family. Witnessing the struggles in her community, she initiated an online campaign, 'Feed the Need,' which quickly grew into a significant source of community support. Her efforts extended to volunteering at a food bank, where she engaged with those in need, offering not just meals but also warmth and humor.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 6, NULL),
  ('5f1ce4b0-00bc-441a-b381-4150d159f49f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The narrative highlights the profound bond between Jiya and her Grandma, particularly during Grandma's battle with COVID-19. Their conversations, filled with metaphors and expressions of love, provided mutual comfort and strength. Grandma's recovery, cheered on by family love and care, became a testament to their collective resilience. The subsequent celebration, marked by shared laughter and favorite desserts, solidified their unity. This experience not only strengthened their family but also inspired them to extend their support to other families facing similar challenges.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 6, NULL),
  ('b61c8799-77d9-44f8-95f9-2474d4facade', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Inspired by their own journey through adversity, Jiya and her Grandma embarked on a healthcare campaign to support and raise awareness among families affected by COVID-19. Jiya, observing the struggles within her community, further expanded her efforts by launching 'Feed the Need,' an online campaign that garnered widespread support. Her commitment to direct action was evident in her volunteering at a food bank, where she personally connected with individuals like the elderly man, whose dire circumstances were met with Jiya's warm smile and humor. This demonstrates a holistic approach to community engagement, combining awareness, direct aid, and personal connection.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 6, NULL),
  ('da9a1009-b4f4-45cd-b5fe-8a6bcff8545c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Throughout the challenging period, both Jiya and her Grandma maintained a remarkably optimistic outlook, often using humor and positive affirmations. Grandma's comparison of Jiya's toughness to 'double-fried fritters' and her belief that 'laughter’s the best medicine' infused their conversations with lightness. Jiya, despite 'juggling school and emotions,' also employed humor, even cracking a joke with an elderly man at the food bank. This consistent use of optimism and humor served not only as a coping mechanism but also as a way to connect with others and spread positivity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 6, NULL),
  ('7f0ee64d-62a4-4b81-8957-790572f1ecaf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. 'Dear heroes, keep saving the world! And if you ever start a band, you've got a groupie right here!' Through her actions, Jiya found a sense of purpose and brought smiles and laughter to those around her. She learnt that even in the darkest times, a little humour and a lot of compassion could light up the darkest corners of the human heart.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3d59820c-1dc8-4f09-ad3a-90a90c3d8e7c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. Through her actions, Jiya found a sense of purpose and brought smiles and laughter to those around her. The text states: 'Kindness is doing what you can, wherever you are, with what you have.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('649aef9d-a57f-42e1-9554-880961f24eae', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. She learnt that even in the darkest times, a little humour and a lot of compassion could light up the darkest corners of the human heart. The text also states: 'Empathy and compassion are the greatest displays of power.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('dfb45d93-5b18-41aa-b00b-2f681b2a9d1e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. 'Dear heroes, keep saving the world! And if you ever start a band, you've got a groupie right here!' The text also prompts: 'Write a message for the Corona Warriors, thanking them for their selfless acts during COVID-19.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('9f1607a5-4700-4c87-a6f2-c9da315039da', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. Through her actions, Jiya found a sense of purpose and brought smiles and laughter to those around her. The NEP Guidelines encourage 'Critical Thinking' and ask: 'Do you know who the front-line workers are?'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1a506339-f218-48c9-9a2d-d971f24c6374', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. She learnt that even in the darkest times, a little humour and a lot of compassion could light up the darkest corners of the human heart. The text suggests using 'Cordova Smart Class Software... to explore the theme of empathy and kindness.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('616803fb-a5dc-4234-a52c-1b2dbebc4035', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Kindness In Crisis class. Talk about the bond you share with your grandparents. How do they influence your life? What special moments have you shared with them? Share your experience in Learning omes After the lesson, I will be able to: read the text with correct pronunciation, intonation and expressions explore and appreciate the theme learn new words and use them in sentences. answer questions based on the story use clauses and their types correctly in sentences write an email This interesting story narrates the ability to find strength and adapt to the new normal despite the 1 uncertainties brought by the pandemic. Let’s read the story and learn about Jiya's perseverance during ! i the pandemic. As the world outside turned uncertain, Jiya found solace in the virtual realities of online classes and endless video calls. She discovered her inner strength, learnt to adapt to the new normal, attended online classes and connected with her friends through video calls. She also found solace in hobbies like painting and gardening. One day, Jiya’s Grandma fell ill with COVID-19. It was a challenging time for the family, but they supported each other with love and care. Despite the fear and uncertainty, Jiya found courage in her heart. One sombre morning, as Jiya practised her newfound hobby of talking to plants (they're great listeners), her mother delivered the news with a heavy heart, “Grandma has tested positive for COVID-19.” The English-8 family’s spirits plummeted, but Jiya wrapped her fear in a blanket of determination. How should the family look after the Grandma? Discuss with your peers all safety measures the family members should take in such a situation. The atmosphere at her Grandma’s bedside was a blend of worry and whispered courage. Jiya squeezed her Grandma’s hand, her voice shaking slightly, “Grandma, how’s the weather up there on your health barometer today?” Her Grandma, always a comedian even in adversity, managed a weak chuckle “Oh, dear Jiya, I'd say it's partly cloudy with a chance of hailstorm. But having you here? That’s my sunshine.” Jiya’s laugh was a mix of relief and concern.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 10, NULL),
  ('d00b2062-d6a3-42b7-bcb6-d720db49e7bf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$“I'm so glad my weather report can brighten your day, Grandma. Just remember, you're tougher than double-fried fritters sold roadside.” “Thank you, Pumpkin. And how are you managing with all this madness?” “It's a circus, Grandma. I'm juggling school and emotions better than a clown with pies. But I miss our kitchen shenanigans and our secret dessert missions,” said Jiya. Her Grandma’s voice softened, “We’ll whip up a storm soon, my chef. Tough times are just life’s way of seasoning us. We’ll come out of this tastier than ever.” Jiya giggled, wiping away a tear. “I love you, Grandma.” “I love you more, my sweet. Now, let’s keep our spirits up. Remember, laughter’s the best medicine and it’s calorie-free!” Weeks later, Jiya’s Grandma fully recovered from COVID-19, cheered on by the family’s love and care. To celebrate, they threw a small home party with their favourite desserts and shared laughter, marking Grandma’s return to health. Jiya, feeling grateful for her family’s safety and unity, gave a toast during the celebration, “To family, laughter and the resilience that carried us through. May we always find strength in each other, no matter the weather.” This moment of joy was a testament to their collective strength. Inspired by their experience, Jiya and her Grandma started a healthcare campaign to give support and promote awareness among other families affected by COVID-19. They hoped to give and spread the same support and positivity they had received. As Jiya witnessed the struggles around her community, her heart went out to those hitting rough patches. She started an online campaign, ‘Feed the Need,” turning a small spark into a wildfire of community support. While volunteering at the food bank, Jiya encountered an elderly man whose wit was as sharp as his circumstances were dire. “Thank you, young lady,” he said, accepting a meal with a twinkle in his eye. Jiya smiled warmly. “We're all in this together. Plus, my cooking’s too delicious to miss out.” “You could say it’s worth getting a reservation for,” he joked, his laughter mingling with Jiya’s. Jiya cracked a joke with the elderly man. What was her purpose? English-8$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 24, NULL),
  ('b10cfad6-03e5-4f9c-9516-63d4414fc8f5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. 'Dear heroes, keep saving the world! And if you ever start a band, you've got a groupie right here!' Through her actions, Jiya found a sense of purpose and brought smiles and laughter to those around her. She learnt that even in the darkest times, a little humour and a lot of compassion could light up the darkest corners of the human heart.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('47240b2f-28a9-4fde-80a8-f790d69f346b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. Through her actions, Jiya found a sense of purpose and brought smiles and laughter to those around her. Kindness is doing what you can, wherever you are, with what you have. Empathy and compassion are the greatest displays of power.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e672bec6-fd1d-4118-8c52-548aca261ebe', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. She learnt that even in the darkest times, a little humour and a lot of compassion could light up the darkest corners of the human heart. Write a message for the Corona Warriors, thanking them for their selfless acts during COVID-19. COMPETENCY-BASED LEARNING — Kindness is doing what you can, wherever you are, with what you have.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4b2b3b9f-fea8-4fef-bc4c-7a2491877ebe', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. Through her actions, Jiya found a sense of purpose and brought smiles and laughter to those around her. [ ANSWER ORALLY (Critical Thinking) Read these words aloud: groupie, volunteering, circumstances, shenanigans, plummeted Do you know who the front-line workers are? Was anyone in your family actively involved in an emergency during the pandemic? Share your experience with your classmates.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('775fc486-b05b-4e90-8729-abe3bccd0e25', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. 'Dear heroes, keep saving the world! And if you ever start a band, you've got a groupie right here!' She learnt that even in the darkest times, a little humour and a lot of compassion could light up the darkest corners of the human heart. Empathy and compassion are the greatest displays of power.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('628b400e-d74c-4019-b158-99c756213d84', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '602b5f9c-6b66-4ec8-9145-8fd9c06ec420', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jiya’s days were also filled with writing notes to healthcare workers, her words blending humour and heartfelt gratitude. Through her actions, Jiya found a sense of purpose and brought smiles and laughter to those around her. She learnt that even in the darkest times, a little humour and a lot of compassion could light up the darkest corners of the human heart. Use Cordova Smart Class Software on the smart board in class to explore the theme of empathy and kindness.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-711Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL);
